    "detailed_description": "Enter the world of <strong>WarForwards</strong>, a unique military academy where cadets train for combat. Join forces with friends, equip your gear, and battle your way to victory through enemy ranks in various locations. Dominate the battlefield with precise shooting and intense close-quarters combat. Show them who's the best and emerge victorious in <strong>WarForwards</strong>.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1081870/extras/2b6a4fd0388f6df0da5916afef9e2b33.poster.avif?t=1725044386\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1081870/extras/2b6a4fd0388f6df0da5916afef9e2b33.webm?t=1725044386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1081870/extras/2b6a4fd0388f6df0da5916afef9e2b33.mp4?t=1725044386\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>In this intense, action-packed game, you'll face off against dozens of enemies armed with a massive arsenal of weapons. Master your skills and tactics to overcome the odds and emerge victorious. Whether you're fighting in the story-driven campaign or battling for survival in endless mode, <strong>WarForwards </strong>offers endless challenges and non-stop action. Play now and become a master of the battlefield.<br><br>Featuring: <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Intense 2D gun battles and dynamic combat<br></li><li>Inspired by the hit movie John Wick<br></li><li>Close-quarters combat in a top-down shooter format<br></li><li>Critical shot mechanics for maximum damage<br></li><li>Thrilling story-driven campaign and endless survival mode<br></li><li>Over 70 weapons to unlock and customize with the perk system<br></li><li>Non-stop action and endless challenges</li></ul><br>",
    "about_the_game": "Enter the world of <strong>WarForwards</strong>, a unique military academy where cadets train for combat. Join forces with friends, equip your gear, and battle your way to victory through enemy ranks in various locations. Dominate the battlefield with precise shooting and intense close-quarters combat. Show them who's the best and emerge victorious in <strong>WarForwards</strong>.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1081870/extras/2b6a4fd0388f6df0da5916afef9e2b33.poster.avif?t=1725044386\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1081870/extras/2b6a4fd0388f6df0da5916afef9e2b33.webm?t=1725044386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1081870/extras/2b6a4fd0388f6df0da5916afef9e2b33.mp4?t=1725044386\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>In this intense, action-packed game, you'll face off against dozens of enemies armed with a massive arsenal of weapons. Master your skills and tactics to overcome the odds and emerge victorious. Whether you're fighting in the story-driven campaign or battling for survival in endless mode, <strong>WarForwards </strong>offers endless challenges and non-stop action. Play now and become a master of the battlefield.<br><br>Featuring: <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Intense 2D gun battles and dynamic combat<br></li><li>Inspired by the hit movie John Wick<br></li><li>Close-quarters combat in a top-down shooter format<br></li><li>Critical shot mechanics for maximum damage<br></li><li>Thrilling story-driven campaign and endless survival mode<br></li><li>Over 70 weapons to unlock and customize with the perk system<br></li><li>Non-stop action and endless challenges</li></ul><br>",
